function stapleWatchSelectionSummary(setup){const count=Number(setup?.watchedItemCount)||0;return `${count} ${copy('stapleWatchCount')} · ${setup?.usualStoreSelected?copy('stapleWatchStoreSet'):copy('stapleWatchStoreMissing')}`}
function stapleWatchProductRow(row){const action=row?.action||{};const key=action.key||'';const nextWatched=Boolean(action.watched);return `<div class="card saved-card"><div class="stack" style="gap:3px"><strong style="font-size:13px">${safe(row?.title||'')}</strong><span class="micro">${row?.watched?copy('stapleWatchStop'):copy('stapleWatchWatch')}</span></div><button class="btn ${row?.watched?'btn-soft':'btn-outline'}" data-action="staple-product" data-key="${safe(key)}" data-watched="${nextWatched?'true':'false'}">${row?.watched?icons('check'):icons('plus')} ${row?.watched?copy('stapleWatchStop'):copy('stapleWatchWatch')}</button></div>`}
function stapleWatchStoreRow(row){const action=row?.action||{};const selected=Boolean(row?.usualStore);const kind=String(action.kind||'');const key=action.key||'';return `<div class="card saved-card"><div class="stack" style="gap:3px"><strong style="font-size:13px">${safe(row?.title||'')}</strong><span class="micro">${selected?copy('stapleWatchClearStore'):copy('stapleWatchUseStore')}</span></div><button class="btn ${selected?'btn-soft':'btn-outline'}" data-action="staple-store" data-kind="${safe(kind)}" data-key="${safe(key)}">${selected?icons('check'):icons('plus')} ${selected?copy('stapleWatchClearStore'):copy('stapleWatchUseStore')}</button></div>`}
function nativeStapleWatch(payload){if(state.nativeStapleWatchPending&&!payload?.state)return `<div class="empty-state">${icons('bookmark')}<strong>${copy('stapleWatchLoading')}</strong><p>${copy('nativeToolDetail')}</p></div>`;const setup=payload?.state;if(!setup)return `<div class="empty-state">${icons('bookmark')}<strong>${copy('stapleWatchNeedTwo')}</strong><p>${copy('nativeSavedIdentityNote')}</p><button class="btn btn-primary" data-nav="search">${copy('searchProducts')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div>`;const products=Array.isArray(setup.products)?setup.products:[];const stores=Array.isArray(setup.stores)?setup.stores:[];const capability=String(setup.factCheckCapability||'');const blocked=setup.status==='DISPLAY_METADATA_INCOMPLETE';const ready=setup.status==='READY_FOR_FACT_CHECK';const progress=setup.factResolutionProgress;return `<div class="card stack"><div class="split"><span class="section-label" style="margin:0">${copy('stapleWatchSummary')}</span><span class="pill ${ready?'green':'orange'}">${safe(stapleStatusLabel(setup.status))}</span></div><strong>${safe(stapleWatchSelectionSummary(setup))}</strong><p class="micro">${safe(blocked?copy('stapleWatchMetadata'):ready?copy('stapleWatchReady'):copy('stapleWatchNeedTwo'))}</p></div>${products.length?`<div class="section-header"><strong>${copy('stapleWatchProducts')}</strong></div><div class="stack">${products.map(stapleWatchProductRow).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="empty-state">${icons('bookmark')}<strong>${copy('stapleWatchNeedTwo')}</strong><p>${copy('nativeSavedIdentityNote')}</p></div>`}${stores.length?`<div class="section-header"><strong>${copy('stapleWatchStore')}</strong></div><div class="stack">${stores.map(stapleWatchStoreRow).join('')}</div>`:''}${progress?`<div class="card stack"><div class="section-label">${copy('stapleWatchFactProgress')}</div><strong>${Number(progress.resolvedRequirementCount)||0} / ${Number(progress.totalRequirementCount)||0} ${copy('stapleWatchFactCount')}</strong><p class="micro">${safe(state.language===LANGUAGES.EN?progress.guidance:copy('stapleWatchCapability'))}</p></div>`:''}${capability==='NOT_CONFIGURED'?`<div class="card stack"><strong>${copy('stapleWatchCapability')}</strong><p class="micro">${copy('stapleWatchClassicDetail')}</p><button class="btn btn-soft btn-fill" data-action="staple-classic">${icons('arrow')} ${copy('stapleWatchClassic')}</button></div>`:''}${setup.continueAvailable?`<button class="btn btn-accent btn-fill" data-action="staple-submit">${icons('arrow')} ${copy('stapleWatchContinue')}</button>`:''}${setup.watchedItemCount||setup.usualStoreSelected?`<button class="tap-link" data-action="staple-clear">${icons('back')} ${copy('stapleWatchClear')}</button>`:''}`}
function stapleWatch(){return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="staple-cancel">${icons('back')} ${copy('stapleWatchBack')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('stapleWatchLabel')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('stapleWatchTitle')}</h1><p class="hero-copy">${copy('stapleWatchIntro')}</p><div class="stack" style="margin-top:12px">${nativeStapleWatch(state.nativeStapleWatchState)}</div></section>`}
function nativeHistorySource(value){switch(String(value||'')){case'Scan & compare':return copy('historySourceScan');case'Is this a good price?':return copy('historySourceGoodPrice');default:return safe(value||'')}}
function nativeHistoryBasis(value){switch(String(value||'')){case'Current price':return copy('historyBasisCurrent');case'Member price':return copy('historyBasisMember');default:return safe(value||'')}}
function nativeHistoryMovement(value){const raw=String(value||'');if(raw.startsWith('Down from previous'))return `${copy('historyMovementDown')} ${safe(raw.slice('Down from previous'.length).trim())}`;if(raw.startsWith('Up from previous'))return `${copy('historyMovementUp')} ${safe(raw.slice('Up from previous'.length).trim())}`;if(raw==='Same as previous observation')return copy('historyMovementSame');return safe(raw)}
function nativeHistoryFact(value){const raw=String(value||'');if(state.language===LANGUAGES.EN)return safe(raw);return safe(raw.replace(/(^|[^A-Za-z0-9])(-?\d+\.\d+)(?![A-Za-z0-9])/g,(match,prefix,number)=>prefix+number.replace('.',',')))}
function nativeHistoryRows(history){const rows=Array.isArray(history?.rows)?history.rows:[];return rows.map(row=>`<article class="card saved-card native-history-row"><div class="stack"><div class="eyebrow">${Number(row.observationCount)||0} ${copy(Number(row.observationCount)===1?'historyObservation':'historyObservations')} · ${nativeHistorySource(row.sourceText)}</div><strong style="font-size:14px">${safe(row.displayName||'')}</strong><div class="number-lg" style="font-size:22px">${nativeHistoryFact(row.latestPriceText)}</div><div class="micro">${copy('historyLastObserved')}: ${nativeHistoryFact(row.latestObservedText)}</div><div class="small">${copy('historyLowestPrice')}: ${nativeHistoryFact(row.lowestPriceText)}</div><div class="small">${copy('historyUnitRate')}: ${nativeHistoryFact(row.latestUnitRateText)}</div><div class="small">${copy('historyRange')}: ${nativeHistoryFact(row.rangeText)}</div><div class="micro">${copy('historyPackage')}: ${nativeHistoryFact(row.packageText)} · ${nativeHistoryBasis(row.priceBasisText)}</div>${row.recentMovementText?`<div class="micro">${nativeHistoryMovement(row.recentMovementText)}</div>`:''}${row.promotionText?`<div class="micro">${copy('historyPromotion')}: ${safe(String(row.promotionText).replace(/^Promotion:\s*/i,''))}</div>`:''}</div></article>`).join('')}
function nativePrivateHistorySummary(payload){const history=payload?.privateHistory;if(!history||history.status==='UNAVAILABLE')return `<div class="card stack"><div class="section-label">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><strong>${copy('nativeHistoryUnavailable')}</strong><p class="micro">${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</p><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-private-history">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div>`;if(history.status==='EMPTY')return `<div class="card stack"><div class="section-label">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><strong>${copy('nativeHistoryEmpty')}</strong><p class="micro">${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</p><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-private-history">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div>`;const observationCount=Number(history.observationCount)||0;const exactCount=Number(history.exactHistoryCount)||0;const countLabel=`${observationCount} ${copy(observationCount===1?'historyObservation':'historyObservations')}`;return `<div class="card stack"><div class="section-label">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><strong>${countLabel} · ${exactCount} ${copy('historyExactPackage')}</strong><p class="micro">${countLabel} ${copy('nativeHistoryAvailable')} · ${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</p>${history.latestDisplayName?`<div class="micro"><strong>${copy('historyLatest')}:</strong> ${safe(history.latestDisplayName)}</div>`:''}${history.rows?.length?`<div class="stack" style="margin-top:4px">${nativeHistoryRows(history)}</div>`:''}<button class="tap-link" data-action="open-private-history">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div>`}
function nativePurchaseHistoryUnavailable(){return `<div class="card stack"><div class="section-label">${copy('purchaseHistoryUnavailable')}</div><strong>${copy('purchaseHistoryUnavailableTitle')}</strong><p class="micro">${copy('purchaseHistoryUnavailableDetail')}</p></div>`}
function privateHistory(){const payload=state.nativeSavedState;const history=payload?.privateHistory;if(state.nativeSavedPending)return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')}</h1><div class="empty-state">${icons('arrow')}<strong>${copy('nativeLoading')}</strong></div></section>`;if(!history||history.status==='UNAVAILABLE')return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')}</h1><div class="card stack"><strong>${copy('nativeHistoryUnavailable')}</strong><p class="micro">${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</p><button class="btn btn-soft btn-fill" data-action="open-private-history">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div></section>`;if(history.status==='EMPTY')return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')}</h1><div class="empty-state">${icons('arrow')}<strong>${copy('nativeHistoryEmpty')}</strong><p>${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</p><button class="btn btn-soft" data-action="open-native-tool" data-destination="PRIVATE_PRICE_HISTORY">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></div></section>`;const observationCount=Number(history.observationCount)||0;const exactCount=Number(history.exactHistoryCount)||0;const countLabel=`${observationCount} ${copy(observationCount===1?'historyObservation':'historyObservations')}`;return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeHistoryTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')}</h1><p class="hero-copy">${countLabel} · ${exactCount} ${copy('historyExactPackage')}</p><div class="preview-notice">${icons('info')} ${copy('nativeHistoryDetail')}</div><div class="stack" style="margin-top:12px">${nativeHistoryRows(history)}</div><button class="btn btn-soft btn-fill" data-action="open-native-tool" data-destination="PRIVATE_PRICE_HISTORY">${copy('reviewPrivateHistory')} ${icons('arrow')}</button></section>`}
function saved(){return `<section class="content"><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeSavedTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('savedTitle')}</h1><p class="hero-copy">${copy('nativeSavedIntro')}</p><div class="card stack" style="margin-top:12px"><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-native-saved-tools">${icons('arrow')} ${copy('openSavedTools')}</button><p class="micro">${copy('openSavedToolsDetail')}</p><div class="stack" style="margin-top:8px"><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-observed-price">${icons('plus')} ${copy('observedPriceTool')}</button><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-native-journey" data-destination="GOOD_PRICE_CHECK">${icons('check')} ${copy('goodPriceTool')}</button><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-staple-watch">${icons('bookmark')} ${copy('stapleWatchTool')}</button><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-private-history">${icons('arrow')} ${copy('privateHistoryTool')}</button></div><p class="micro">${copy('nativeToolDetail')}</p></div>${nativeSavedResults(state.nativeSavedState)}${nativePrivateHistorySummary(state.nativeSavedState)}${nativePurchaseHistoryUnavailable()}<div class="section-header"><strong>${copy('otherTools')}</strong></div><div class="card stack"><button class="tap-link" data-nav="trip">${icons('route')} ${copy('tripEstimator')}</button><button class="tap-link" data-action="open-native-journey" data-destination="COMPARE">${icons('sliders')} ${copy('compareTool')}</button><p class="micro">${copy('compareToolDetail')}</p></div></section>`}
function trip(){return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('nativeTripTitle')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('tripTitle')}</h1><p class="hero-copy">${copy('nativeTripIntro')}</p><div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><form id="tripForm" class="stack"><label class="small">${copy('distance')}<input name="distance" inputmode="decimal" type="number" required min="0" step="0.1" value="${safe(state.tripInputs.distance)}" placeholder="${safe(copy('exampleDistance'))}" class="inline-form-input"></label><label class="small">${copy('consumption')}<input name="consumption" inputmode="decimal" type="number" required min="0" step="0.1" value="${safe(state.tripInputs.consumption)}" placeholder="${safe(copy('exampleConsumption'))}" class="inline-form-input"></label><label class="small">${copy('fuelPrice')}<input name="fuel" inputmode="decimal" type="number" required min="0" step="0.1" value="${safe(state.tripInputs.fuel)}" placeholder="${safe(copy('fuelPlaceholder'))}" class="inline-form-input"></label><label class="small">${copy('tolls')}<input name="tolls" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="${safe(state.tripInputs.tolls)}" class="inline-form-input"></label><label class="small">${copy('parking')}<input name="parking" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="${safe(state.tripInputs.parking)}" class="inline-form-input"></label><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-fill">${icons('route')} ${copy('calculate')}</button></form>${nativeTripResults(state.nativeTripState)}</div><div class="preview-notice" style="margin-top:14px">${icons('info')} ${copy('tripNotice')}</div></section>`}
function settings(){return `<section class="content"><button class="detail-back" data-action="back">${icons('back')} ${copy('back')}</button><div class="eyebrow">${copy('previewPreferences')}</div><h1 class="page-title">${copy('personalize')}</h1><div class="settings-panel"><div class="setting-row"><span>${copy('visualTheme')}</span><select id="themeChoice" aria-label="${safe(copy('chooseTheme'))}"><option value="light" ${state.theme==='light'?'selected':''}>${copy('light')}</option><option value="dark" ${state.theme==='dark'?'selected':''}>${copy('dark')}</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><span>${copy('language')}</span><div class="language-toggle" role="group" aria-label="${safe(copy('language'))}"><button type="button" data-language="en" aria-pressed="${state.language===LANGUAGES.EN?'true':'false'}">EN</button><span aria-hidden="true">|</span><button type="button" data-language="es-AR" aria-pressed="${state.language===LANGUAGES.ES_AR?'true':'false'}">ES</button></div></div><div class="setting-row"><span>${copy('market')}</span><button class="tap-link" data-action="choose-search-location">${safe(nativeAreaLabel())} · ${copy('changeLocation')}</button></div></div><div class="preview-notice" style="margin-top:15px">${icons('info')} ${copy('settingsNotice')}</div></section>`}

function openNativeBasket(){try{if(window.ValuePilotHost&&typeof window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage==='function'){window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage(JSON.stringify({type:'OPEN_NATIVE_BASKET'}));return true}}catch(_){ }flash(copy('nativeBasketUnavailable'));return false}function openNativeSavedTools(destination='SAVED'){const allowed=new Set(['SAVED','OBSERVED_PRICE_SELECTION','STAPLE_WATCH_SETUP','PRIVATE_PRICE_HISTORY']);const next=allowed.has(destination)?destination:'SAVED';try{if(window.ValuePilotHost&&typeof window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage==='function'){window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage(JSON.stringify({type:'OPEN_NATIVE_SAVED_TOOLS',destination:next}));return true}}catch(_){ }flash(copy('nativeSavedPersistence'));return false}
function openNativeJourney(destination){const allowed=new Set(['GOOD_PRICE_CHECK','COMPARE']);if(!allowed.has(destination)){flash(copy('nativeJourneyUnavailable'));return false}try{if(window.ValuePilotHost&&typeof window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage==='function'){window.ValuePilotHost.postMessage(JSON.stringify({type:'OPEN_NATIVE_JOURNEY',destination}));return true}}catch(_){ }flash(copy('nativeJourneyUnavailable'));return false}
// Event delegation for a small, auditable WebView surface.
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(state.matrixSuppressClickUntil&&Date.now()<state.matrixSuppressClickUntil&&event.target.closest('#matrixScroll')){state.matrixSuppressClickUntil=0;event.preventDefault();event.stopImmediatePropagation()}},true);
document.addEventListener('click',(event)=>{const languageButton=event.target.closest('[data-language]');if(languageButton){event.preventDefault();setLanguage(languageButton.dataset.language);return}const el=event.target.closest('[data-action],[data-nav]');if(!el)return;event.preventDefault();const a=el.dataset.action,id=el.dataset.id,identityKey=el.dataset.identityKey,offerKey=el.dataset.offerKey,displayName=el.dataset.displayName,brand=el.dataset.brand,quantity=el.dataset.quantity,query=el.dataset.query;if(el.dataset.nav){navigate(el.dataset.nav,{from:state.page});return}
switch(a){case'choose-search-location':requestSearchLocation();break;case'go-search':{state.query=document.querySelector('#homeQuery')?.value||'leche';navigate('search',{from:'home'});requestNativeSearch(state.query);break}case'back':back();break;case'photos':openPhotos(id);break;case'native-load-more':requestNativeSearchLoadMore();break;case'native-previous-page':requestNativeSearchPage(true);break;case'native-clarification-more':requestNativeSearchClarificationMore();break;case'native-clarification':requestNativeSearch(el.dataset.query||state.query,el.dataset.choiceId||null);break;case'native-save':requestNativeSave(id);break;case'native-detail':requestNativeProductDetail(identityKey,query);break;case'native-map':requestNativeMap(identityKey,offerKey,query);break;case'matrix-sort':state.matrixSort=el.dataset.sort||'unit';render();break;case'native-detail-save':requestNativeDetailSave();break;case'native-remove-saved':requestNativeRemove(identityKey);break;case'native-refresh-saved':requestNativeSaved();break;case'native-plan':requestNativeBasketPlan();break;case'native-good-price':requestNativeGoodPrice(identityKey,displayName);break;case'native-saved-photos':requestNativeSavedGoogleImages(brand,displayName,quantity);break;case'open-native-saved-tools':openNativeSavedTools('SAVED');break;case'open-observed-price':navigate('observed-price');break;case'open-staple-watch':navigate('staple-watch');break;case'open-private-history':navigate('private-history');break;case'observed-select':requestNativeObservedSelection(el.dataset.kind,el.dataset.key);break;case'observed-check':requestNativeObservedPrefill();break;case'observed-set-price':requestNativeObservedAmount();break;case'observed-set-time':requestNativeObservedTime();break;case'observed-proof-type':state.observedPriceForm.proofType=el.dataset.proofType||'';render();break;case'observed-set-proof':requestNativeObservedProof();break;case'observed-proof-picker':requestNativeObservedProofPicker();break;case'observed-submit':requestNativeObservedSubmit();break;case'observed-cancel':requestNativeObservedCancel();break;case'staple-product':requestNativeStapleProduct(el.dataset.key,el.dataset.watched==='true');break;case'staple-store':el.dataset.kind==='CLEAR_STORE'?requestNativeStapleClearStore():requestNativeStapleStore(el.dataset.key);break;case'staple-classic':openNativeSavedTools('STAPLE_WATCH_SETUP');break;case'staple-clear':requestNativeStapleClearSelection();break;case'staple-submit':requestNativeStapleSubmit();break;case'staple-cancel':requestNativeStapleCancel();break;case'open-native-basket':openNativeBasket();break;case'open-native-tool':openNativeSavedTools(el.dataset.destination||'SAVED');break;case'open-native-journey':openNativeJourney(el.dataset.destination||'COMPARE');break;case'category':{const category=el.dataset.category||'Todos';state.category=category;if(category==='Todos')state.query='';else state.query=category;if(state.page==='home')navigate('search',{from:'home'});else render();requestNativeSearch(state.query);break}case'show-all':state.query='';state.category='Todos';render();requestNativeSearch(state.query);break;}
});
document.querySelector('#settingsButton').addEventListener('click',()=>navigate('settings'));
document.querySelector('#themeToggle').addEventListener('click',()=>setTheme(state.theme==='light'?'dark':'light'));
document.addEventListener('change',(e)=>{if(e.target.id==='themeChoice')setTheme(e.target.value)});
document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{if(e.target.id==='searchForm'){e.preventDefault();const input=e.target.querySelector('input');state.query=input.value;state.matrixScrollTop=0;state.matrixScrollLeft=0;requestNativeSearch(state.query);document.activeElement.blur();return}if(e.target.id==='tripForm'){e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(e.target);for(const name of Object.keys(state.tripInputs))state.tripInputs[name]=String(fd.get(name)||'');const d=Number(state.tripInputs.distance),c=Number(state.tripInputs.consumption),f=Number(state.tripInputs.fuel),t=Number(state.tripInputs.tolls),p=Number(state.tripInputs.parking);if([d,c,f,t,p].some(v=>!Number.isFinite(v)||v<0)||c<=0){flash(copy('invalidInputs'));return}requestNativeTrip({distance:d,consumption:c,fuel:f,tolls:t,parking:p});return}});
document.addEventListener('change',(e)=>{if(e.target.id==='matrixStore'){state.matrixStore=e.target.value||'all';render()}else if(e.target.id==='matrixSort'){state.matrixSort=e.target.value||'unit';render()}});
document.addEventListener('input',(e=>{if(e.target.id==='searchQuery')state.query=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedAmount')state.observedPriceForm.amount=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedCurrency')state.observedPriceForm.currency=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedDate')state.observedPriceForm.date=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedTime')state.observedPriceForm.time=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedOffset')state.observedPriceForm.utcOffset=e.target.value;if(e.target.id==='observedArtifact')state.observedPriceForm.artifactId=e.target.value;if(e.target.closest('#tripForm')){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(state.tripInputs,e.target.name))state.tripInputs[e.target.name]=e.target.value;const result=document.querySelector('#tripResult');if(result)result.hidden=true}}));
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('#clearQuery')){state.query='';state.nativeSelectionId=null;state.nativeSearchState=null;state.nativeSearchPending=false;document.querySelector('#searchQuery').value='';state.matrixScrollTop=0;state.matrixScrollLeft=0;document.querySelector('#resultsArea').innerHTML=nativeResults(null);document.querySelector('#searchQuery').focus()}});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' ')&&e.target.matches('tr.matrix-row')){e.preventDefault();e.target.click();return}if(e.key==='Escape'&&state.page!=='home'){back()}});
// Android host adapter: this is non-visual and keeps system back behavior inside the
// HTML surface without exposing private state to a privileged native interface.
 window.ValuePilotHtmlPreview = Object.freeze({
  back:()=>{if(state.page==='home')return false;back();return true},
  page:()=>state.page,
  language:()=>state.language,
  setLanguage:(language)=>{setLanguage(language,{persist:false});return state.language},
  receiveNativeLocation:(label,changed=false)=>{receiveNativeLocation(label,changed);return true},
  receiveNativeSearch:(payload)=>{receiveNativeSearch(payload);return true},
  receiveNativeProductDetail:(payload)=>{receiveNativeProductDetail(payload);return true},
  refreshNativeSaved:()=>{if(!state.nativeSavedEnabled||state.nativeSavedPending)return false;requestNativeSaved();return true},
  receiveNativeActionNotice:(payload)=>receiveNativeActionNotice(payload),
   receiveNativeSaved:(payload)=>{receiveNativeSaved(payload);return true},
  receiveNativeTrip:(payload)=>{receiveNativeTrip(payload);return true},
  receiveNativeObservedPrice:(payload)=>{receiveNativeObservedPrice(payload);return true},
  receiveNativeStapleWatch:(payload)=>{receiveNativeStapleWatch(payload);return true},
  returnToSaved:()=>{state.nativeStapleWatchPending=false;state.nativeStapleWatchState=null;navigate('saved',{skipHistory:true});return true},
});
// Security: this surface never persists, parses, or uses external image results.
render();
